"P3504943153" "There's a problem in Steel Canyon that I think you may be able to solve. The Council has been sabotaging a lot of businesses in the area: computer companies, scientific labs, anyone who might be producing technology that can aid Paragon City. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to get to Steel Canyon and stop the Council sabotage.</A>"
