"P475342801" "Well, Adjutant {BOSS_NAME} gave us all the information we needed - and more. According to {BOSS_NAME}, the Council has a number of cells spread throughout the city, and each of them reports to a major base of operations on Striga Isle. {HeroName}, that scares me. It could be that the Council is a greater threat than we had ever guessed!"
